Source: ragnar-desktop
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Maintainer: LieraOS Project <projekt@lieraos.local>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), meson, ninja-build, python3
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: ragnar-core
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ragnar-session, gammastep, grim, slurp, swaybg, swayidle,
 wlopm, python3, python3-dbus, python3-gi, python3-psutil,
 dconf-gsettings-backend | gsettings-backend,
 ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Ragnar desktop session glue
 Session scripts, labwc bridge, GSettings schemas, icons and data
 for the Ragnar desktop. The desktop stack itself is implemented by
 the ragnar-* Rust components; this package carries the glue.

Package: ragnar-desktop
Architecture: all
Depends: blueman, ragnar-core (>= 1.0-37), dconf-cli, ragnar-heimdall,
 notification-daemon, python3-psutil, xdotool, wdisplays, wlr-randr,
 mesa-utils, dconf-gsettings-backend | gsettings-backend,
 ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: xdg-desktop-portal-wlr, ragnar-view
Description: Desktop package for ragnar-desktop
 Meta package pulling the Ragnar desktop environment together:
 GSettings overrides, greeter badge and runtime dependencies.
